{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search for and retrieve object. If found, approach, grab, and retrieve it. If not found, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Action ID = MoveToSearchArea    /> <SubTree ID = RetrieveObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    />",
